# Claude Code local state. settings.local.json is this machine's own
# permission choices, and worktrees/ holds throwaway checkouts an agent
# creates while it works and removes when it finishes. Neither is project
# code. Shared project config (.claude/settings.json, skills, agents) is not
# ignored and can still be committed.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
